crates/pumpkin-data/src/generated/translation.rs:75139:                "Elytra cannot be crafted, but are found in Item Frames in rare End Ships, guarded by fearsome Shulkers.",
crates/pumpkin-data/src/generated/translation.rs:75525:                "A §epickaxe§f:wood_pickaxe: helps you uncover all sorts of materials, such as stone, coal, iron, and precious ore - though you may need extra sturdy tools for some rarer materials!",
