tEnemy` INLINED (`Player::attack`/`Mob::try_attack` successful-hit durability and post-hit paths; the base vanilla body is empty); `interactLivingEntity` RENAMED (`ItemBehaviour::use_on_entity`, dispatched by `ItemRegistry::use_on_entity`). Supplemental implementation greps this run found `KineticWeaponImpl` in generated spear data, `get_max_use_time` callers in both packet handlers and living/blocking/AI paths, and no BLOCKED lead.` |
